{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/2b3ab16407a2964c765c5cee98b6a360.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/2b3ab16407a2964c765c5cee98b6a360.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/2b3ab16407a2964c765c5cee98b6a360.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Thousand Cloys is an incremental game in which you have to explore and cleanse a planet of its Klein radiation, while unravelling its mysteries. In order to do that, your employer thankfully provides you with Cloys, high-tech toasters able to mine materials in hazardous conditions! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover and build your skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/4a6efdbeddcc2d6c35dac05101548ea2.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/4a6efdbeddcc2d6c35dac05101548ea2.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/4a6efdbeddcc2d6c35dac05101548ea2.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree nodes are hidden throughout the world, and unearthing them as you explore further will make your task a lot easier! Lift the fog of radiation shrouding the planet and uncover pulsating fields, monoliths and other oddities. Study them, repair them, build them, upgrade them and become a true harvesting machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/8dfd271be2ed912c51bc6bd8e51b7345.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/8dfd271be2ed912c51bc6bd8e51b7345.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/8dfd271be2ed912c51bc6bd8e51b7345.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chose whether you want to idle while your Cloys work automatically, or play more actively. Harvest all kinds of resources, improve your clicks and your Cloys, build new structures, and harvest more resources! The pace is steady, and the numbers remain understandable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an alien world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/de7c3d2bfe605aec0e008b379f6883d7.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/de7c3d2bfe605aec0e008b379f6883d7.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/de7c3d2bfe605aec0e008b379f6883d7.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet you've been assigned to cleanse isn't just an empty field. Some weird structures stand, hidden between towering mountains, in the middle of acid lakes or behind mysterious doors... Explore its nooks and crannies in order to become always more efficient at your job!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restart stronger, faster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/6d36a6df6d704e7d2ef12972648c5257.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/6d36a6df6d704e7d2ef12972648c5257.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/6d36a6df6d704e7d2ef12972648c5257.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've accumulated a big enough payout during a session, end it, upgrade your permanent outposts, let the world rest, and start a new session to earn an even bigger payout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cloys Inc., the universe's leading toaster company, and your new family! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've joined our environmental arm, where we improve the universe, one planet at a time! We are delighted to have you with us, and we are sure you will find fulfillment in this vital mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned a processed planet to be cleansed of its Klein radiation. The connection zone has been calculated and a portal is ready to be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living Resources - Nole Fissact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is an automated email, please do not reply.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861740?t=1765027483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/0c5b4659bc9175616252bc7f4b9435c3d4465b1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765027483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/065cfda9fdae4c0503426a44824fdd48f6669d11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765027483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/065cfda9fdae4c0503426a44824fdd48f6669d11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765027483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4140860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/2b3ab16407a2964c765c5cee98b6a360.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/2b3ab16407a2964c765c5cee98b6a360.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/2b3ab16407a2964c765c5cee98b6a360.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Thousand Cloys is an incremental game in which you have to explore and cleanse a planet of its Klein radiation, while unravelling its mysteries. In order to do that, your employer thankfully provides you with Cloys, high-tech toasters able to mine materials in hazardous conditions! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover and build your skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/4a6efdbeddcc2d6c35dac05101548ea2.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/4a6efdbeddcc2d6c35dac05101548ea2.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/4a6efdbeddcc2d6c35dac05101548ea2.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree nodes are hidden throughout the world, and unearthing them as you explore further will make your task a lot easier! Lift the fog of radiation shrouding the planet and uncover pulsating fields, monoliths and other oddities. Study them, repair them, build them, upgrade them and become a true harvesting machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/8dfd271be2ed912c51bc6bd8e51b7345.poster.avif?t=1765027483\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/8dfd271be2ed912c51bc6bd8e51b7345.webm?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/8dfd271be2ed912c51bc6bd8e51b7345.mp4?t=1765027483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chose whether you want to id